  "scopes": [
    {
      "claim_id": "C3",
      "stage": "最终lPGS-nTA光交联，而非前体合成",
      "visible_scope": {
        "pointer": "/case/sections/1/blocks/4",
        "quote": "A stage distinction matters here. The statement that no additional photoinitiator or oxidant is needed concerns photo-crosslinking of the final lPGS-nTA building block. For preparation of lPGS-NH₂, SI physical p. 5 explicitly adds 65 mg of a photoinitiator labeled Irgacure 259, followed by 3 h irradiation and dialysis. TA coupling also uses DMF/water and triethylamine. An advantage of the terminal crosslinking step cannot be extended to the entire preparation route, nor does it establish biological safety of the final product."
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C8",
      "stage": "干燥SEM与湿态力学分别评价",
      "visible_scope": {
        "pointer": "/case/sections/3/blocks/7",
        "quote": "Fig. 2e/f adds morphology. Within each material, dried samples change from irregular structures before irradiation to more evident fibrous/network-like structures afterward, with the 15TA set appearing denser. However, the caption specifies lyophilization; the SI method also lists high-vacuum drying and gold coating. These images complement wet-state rheology but do not directly show the hydrogel's working hydrated pore network or identify disulfide bonds. Chemical response, macroscopic gelation, wet mechanics and dry morphology answer different parts of the problem, together supporting the authors' network-design interpretation."
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C14",
      "stage": "模型平台向生物应用的外推",
      "visible_scope": {
        "pointer": "/case/sections/6/blocks/1",
        "quote": "The best-supported meaning of 'mucus-inspired' is that selected structural features, a disulfide-crosslinking design and measured viscoelastic behavior are combined in one platform. The authors' prospects for biological models and other macromolecular materials warrant further testing. Pathogen defense, irradiation compatibility with live cells, long-term stability and repeated recovery require their own experiments; none follows from a G′ value near a natural-mucus range. A next close reading should inspect original rheology and sample replication for the intended application before designing tests of hydrated structure, linkage specificity and biological function."
      }
    }
  ],
